# Line-ending policy: golden vectors, their hash manifest, and shell
# scripts are hashed or parsed byte-sensitively, so every checkout on every
# OS must materialize identical bytes. Without this, Windows checkouts
# (autocrlf=true) produce CRLF and break the golden gate on a clean tree
# or confuse bash.
golden/*.txt text eol=lf
golden/SHA256SUMS text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
